My quick two cents, I think there will be sensitivities on this, but as
long as we stay open to other requests I think it'll be ok.

Sent from my iPhone

On May 22, 2015, at 8:04 PM, Robby Mook <re47@hillaryclinton.com> wrote:

I really like the idea of joining by video because it's SO easy and will
get so many brownie points.  What worries me is that other unions will ask
why we haven't done their stuff.  But maybe this won't be regarded as
"their" event.

